factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script and slides_spec say the 3 youths were arrested in Bothanur (போத்தனூர்) area, while the article places the arrest at Vellalore bus stand (வெள்ளலூர் பேருந்து நிலையம்) area; Bothanur is only the police station jurisdiction, so the location is mixed up.
  The reel_script says the 3 youths were arrested 'in the Bothanur area' ('போத்தனூர் பகுதியில் கஞ்சா விற்ற 3 இளைஞர்கள்'), but the article says they were caught at Vellalore; the sale location is not stated in the article as Bothanur.
  The reel_script states 'போலீசார் ரோந்துப் பணியில் இருந்தனர்' with 'வெள்ளலூரில' but the reel_script's first sentence and the slides' 'loc' field tag the arrest location inconsistently (Vellalore, Bothanur); the headline's 'போத்தனூரில் கஞ்சா விற்ற' also attributes the sale to Bothanur without the article saying so explicitly.
  The reel_script omits the arrest of the three people as an action of the police in the first sentence only partially: it says 'போலீசாரால் கைது செய்யப்பட்டனர்' but the slides' 'hl1' says 'போத்தனூரில் கஞ்சா விற்ற 3 பேர் கைது' which mixes the location of sale with the police station name.
